{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2ngsvawz","type":"work","title":"樂府遺音","authors":[{"name":"瞿佑","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9behq"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《樂府遺音》•五卷","author_info":"明瞿佑撰","summary":"明瞿佑撰。佑有《四時宜忌》，已著錄。是集自卷一至卷二皆古樂府，自卷三至卷五皆詞曲。其古樂府綺靡軟熟，近於溫、李，不出元末習氣。詞欲兼學南、北宋，反致夾雜不純，殊不稱其名也。","edition":"浙江汪啟淑家藏本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《樂府遺音》一卷","author_info":"(明)瞿佑撰","summary":"《樂府遺音》一卷。(明)瞿佑撰。影印國家圖書館藏明抄本。","edition":"影印國家圖書館藏明抄本","volume":"第1723冊","section":"集部 集部"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《樂府遺音》一卷","author_info":"明瞿佑撰","summary":"《樂府遺音》一卷。明瞿佑撰。北京圖書館藏明鈔本。","edition":"北京圖書館藏明鈔本","volume":"第422冊","section":"集部"}],"juan_count":{"number":5},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-chaoben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02110457","metadata":{"edition":"抄本","version":"v4","total_page":68,"paragraph_count":261,"has_translation":true,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02110457.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC1723%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":1723},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%A8%82%E5%BA%9C%E9%81%BA%E9%9F%B3.djvu"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":5}],"measure_info":"五卷","updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:41:40+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"ming","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「明」","dynasty":"明","dynasty_basis":"author_propagation","ai_note":"[ming-round1: author.dynasty 集合=['明'] → dynasty=明]\n\n2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴成，**每節皆據本條 indexed_by 之引文，不出其外，亦不臆造**。凡著錄所無者一字不書。此即 curate-dynasty S3〈